---
import { loadSiteContent, textField } from '@omnireach/site-runtime';
const content = loadSiteContent();
const marquee = textField(content, 'home.marquee', 'NIGHT MARKET 44');
const dishes = ['Fictional ember noodles', 'Imaginary citrus rice', 'Demonstration tea'];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="A fictional, custom-designed restaurant contract fixture."/><title>Night Market 44 — Fictional</title><style>
:root{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#111;color:#f5ff3d}body{margin:0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;min-height:100vh}.main{padding:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem);border-right:1px solid currentColor}h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,13vw,11rem);letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:.75;margin:.2em 0}.side{padding:2rem;background:#f5ff3d;color:#111}li{padding:1rem 0;border-bottom:2px solid}a{color:inherit} @media(max-width:45rem){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.main{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid}.side{min-height:30vh}}</style></head><body><main class="grid"><section class="main"><p>FICTIONAL CUSTOM FIXTURE / NO REAL BUSINESS</p><h1>{marquee}</h1><p>This deliberately custom composition shares contract semantics—not components or layout—with the starter.</p></section><aside class="side"><h2>Invented menu</h2><ul>{dishes.map((dish)=><li>{dish}</li>)}</ul><p>Hours are a protected fact and are intentionally omitted until verified.</p></aside></main></body></html>
